WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.985 --> 00:00:10.186
&gt;&gt; Sean: BIG NEWS.

00:00:09.486 --> 00:00:12.655
FOX NEWS ALERT.

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:13.256
REPUBLICANS ON THE HOUSE INTEL

00:00:12.789 --> 00:00:13.990
COMMITTEE RELEASING THE

00:00:13.389 --> 00:00:16.693
INITIAL FINDINGS AFTER THE

00:00:14.124 --> 00:00:17.193
COMMITTEE ENDED THIS PART OF

00:00:16.826 --> 00:00:18.828
THE RUSE PROBE.

00:00:17.327 --> 00:00:20.296
THEY CONCLUDE NO EVIDENCE OF

00:00:18.962 --> 00:00:20.997
TRUMP RUSSIA COLLUSION IN THE

00:00:20.430 --> 00:00:22.432
2016 ELECTION.

00:00:21.131 --> 00:00:22.966
WE HAVE BEEN LIED TO ALL THIS

00:00:22.565 --> 00:00:24.768
TIME.

00:00:23.099 --> 00:00:26.402
EARLIER TODAY, PRIOR TO THE

00:00:24.901 --> 00:00:27.871
REPORT, I SAT DOWN WITH THE

00:00:26.536 --> 00:00:29.005
VICE PRESIDENT MIKE PENCE FOR

00:00:28.004 --> 00:00:30.440
EXCLUSIVE INTERVIEW AND I

00:00:29.139 --> 00:00:31.808
ASKED THE VICE PRESIDENT ABOUT

00:00:30.573 --> 00:00:34.878
CALIFORNIA REFUSING TO ENFORCE

00:00:31.941 --> 00:00:36.179
FEDERAL IMMIGRATION LAWS, JOY

00:00:35.011 --> 00:00:36.579
BEHAR ATTACKING HIS FAITH AND

00:00:36.312 --> 00:00:39.315
MORE.

00:00:36.713 --> 00:00:41.017
TAKE A LOOK.

00:00:39.449 --> 00:00:42.452
YOU HAVE SANCTUARY CITIES AND

00:00:41.151 --> 00:00:42.852
NOW A SANCTUARY STATE OF

00:00:42.585 --> 00:00:43.787
CALIFORNIA.

00:00:42.986 --> 00:00:44.587
THE PRESIDENT EXPECTED TO GO

00:00:43.920 --> 00:00:46.256
TO CALIFORNIA TOMORROW.

00:00:44.721 --> 00:00:48.158
THEN YOU HAVE DEFIANT OAKLAND

00:00:46.389 --> 00:00:51.161
MAYOR WHO IS TIPPING OFF

00:00:48.291 --> 00:00:53.263
ILLEGAL, CRIMINAL ILLEGAL

00:00:51.294 --> 00:00:55.198
IMMIGRANTS THAT I.C.E. AND

00:00:53.396 --> 00:00:56.266
BORDER ARE COMING THEIR WAY.

00:00:55.331 --> 00:00:57.100
WHAT SHOULD HAPPEN?

00:00:56.399 --> 00:00:58.668
THE ATTORNEY GENERAL WENT SO

00:00:57.233 --> 00:01:00.670
FAR TO SAY THEY WILL USE EVERY

00:00:58.802 --> 00:01:01.204
TOOL THEY HAVE AGAINST THE

00:01:00.804 --> 00:01:02.705
OAKLAND MAYOR.

00:01:01.337 --> 00:01:04.274
IS THAT A CRIME IN YOUR VIEW?

00:01:02.839 --> 00:01:04.874
IS THAT OBSTRUCTION OF

00:01:04.407 --> 00:01:05.608
JUSTICE?

00:01:05.074 --> 00:01:08.278
&gt;&gt; Vice President Pence: WE

00:01:05.742 --> 00:01:10.213
ARE A NATION OF LAWS, SEAN.

00:01:08.411 --> 00:01:12.448
ALL OF US TAKE THE OATH OF

00:01:10.346 --> 00:01:12.816
OFFICE TO SERVE AT EVERY

00:01:12.582 --> 00:01:13.817
LEVEL.

00:01:12.949 --> 00:01:14.651
TAKE AN OATH TO THE

00:01:13.950 --> 00:01:15.018
CONSTITUTION OF THE UNITED

00:01:14.784 --> 00:01:16.653
STATES.

00:01:15.151 --> 00:01:18.221
AND FOR STATE OFFICIALS TO THE

00:01:16.786 --> 00:01:21.257
CONSTITUTION OF THAT STATE.

00:01:18.354 --> 00:01:23.760
I MEAN TO HAVE AN ELECTIVE

00:01:21.391 --> 00:01:25.061
MAYOR IN OAKLAND, CALIFORNIA,

00:01:23.893 --> 00:01:26.162
SAYING THEY ARE NOT GOING TO

00:01:25.195 --> 00:01:26.696
UPHOLD THE LAW ON THE UNITED

00:01:26.296 --> 00:01:27.864
STATES OF AMERICA.

00:01:26.896 --> 00:01:28.965
&gt;&gt; Sean: WORSE, HELPING

00:01:27.997 --> 00:01:29.866
PEOPLE WHO HAVE BROKEN THE

00:01:29.098 --> 00:01:30.533
LAW.

00:01:30.066 --> 00:01:31.768
&gt;&gt; Vice President Pence:

00:01:30.667 --> 00:01:33.136
LOOK, THE MAYOR'S ACTIONS ARE

00:01:31.901 --> 00:01:33.503
DISGRACEFUL ON A COUPLE OF

00:01:33.269 --> 00:01:35.839
LEVELS.

00:01:33.636 --> 00:01:37.307
SHE IS SETTING ASIDE HER OATH

00:01:35.972 --> 00:01:39.075
OF OFFICE TO UPHOLD THE LAW OF

00:01:37.440 --> 00:01:41.010
THE LAND AND THE RULE OF LAW.

00:01:39.209 --> 00:01:42.512
SECONDLY, I SPOKE TO THE

00:01:41.144 --> 00:01:44.781
ATTORNEY GENERAL ABOUT THIS.

00:01:42.645 --> 00:01:46.216
THE MAJORITY OF INFORMATIONS

00:01:44.914 --> 00:01:47.984
TARGETED -- THE MAJORITY OF

00:01:46.349 --> 00:01:49.185
THE INDIVIDUALS TARGETED BY

00:01:48.117 --> 00:01:50.954
I.C.E. HAD A CRIMINAL RECORD.

00:01:49.319 --> 00:01:52.789
SO FOR THE MAYOR OF OAKLAND TO

00:01:51.087 --> 00:01:55.925
WARN THEM IN ADVANCE OF THE

00:01:52.922 --> 00:01:56.793
ACTIONS BY I.C.E. PERSONNEL

00:01:56.059 --> 00:01:58.194
PUT THE LAW ENFORCEMENT

00:01:56.926 --> 00:02:00.964
OFFICERS AT RISK.

00:01:58.328 --> 00:02:04.300
THIS IS UTTERLY UNACCEPTABLE.

00:02:01.097 --> 00:02:05.501
WE NEED TO FIX BROKEN

00:02:04.434 --> 00:02:07.303
IMMIGRATION SYSTEM.

00:02:05.635 --> 00:02:08.504
WE NEED TO FIX THE SYSTEM TO

00:02:07.437 --> 00:02:09.505
PUT AMERICAN CITIZENS AND

00:02:08.638 --> 00:02:10.306
AMERICAN WORKERS FIRST.

00:02:09.639 --> 00:02:12.575
WE CAN DO THAT.

00:02:10.440 --> 00:02:16.279
THE ANSWER IS NOT THE CIVIL

00:02:12.709 --> 00:02:16.913
DISOBEDIENCE THAT WE SEE IN

00:02:16.412 --> 00:02:17.714
MUNICIPAL GOVERNMENTS AND

00:02:17.046 --> 00:02:19.983
STATE OF CALIFORNIA THAT ARE

00:02:17.847 --> 00:02:23.586
SIMPLY SAYING WE GOING TO SET

00:02:20.116 --> 00:02:28.625
ASIDE A RECOGNITION, FEDERAL

00:02:23.720 --> 00:02:33.796
LAW, BECAUSE WE DISAGREE WITH

00:02:28.758 --> 00:02:35.331
IT.

00:02:33.930 --> 00:02:36.566
WE ASK FOR LEADERS TO RESPECT

00:02:35.465 --> 00:02:38.234
THE RULE OF LAW AND PUT THE

00:02:36.699 --> 00:02:40.203
SAFETY AND THE SECURITY OF LAW

00:02:38.368 --> 00:02:41.771
ENFORCEMENT PERSONNEL FIRST.

00:02:40.403 --> 00:02:43.573
&gt;&gt; Sean: YOU HAVE AN

00:02:41.905 --> 00:02:47.210
INCIDENT, THE COMMENTS MADE BY

00:02:43.706 --> 00:02:48.645
JOY BEHAR OF "THE VIEW" WHERE

00:02:47.343 --> 00:02:55.218
SAID SHE CALLED YOU PRIVATELY

00:02:48.778 --> 00:02:55.885
TO APOLOGIZE.

00:02:55.351 --> 00:02:59.789
TELL US WHAT HAPPENED.

00:02:56.019 --> 00:03:02.992
SHE DIDN'T SAY IT PUBLICLY.

00:02:59.923 --> 00:03:05.328
THE INITIAL COMMENTS WERE MADE

00:03:03.126 --> 00:03:06.863
PUBLICLY.

00:03:05.528 --> 00:03:07.964
&gt;&gt; MY CHRISTIAN FAITH IS THE

00:03:06.996 --> 00:03:08.364
MOST IMPORTANT THING IN MY

00:03:08.097 --> 00:03:09.966
LIFE.

00:03:08.498 --> 00:03:11.935
MY WIFE AND I SPEND MOST

00:03:10.099 --> 00:03:13.469
MORNINGS, A LITTLE BIT OF TIME

00:03:12.068 --> 00:03:14.570
ON THE BIBLE AND A LITTLE BIT

00:03:13.603 --> 00:03:16.606
OF TIME IN PRAYER.

00:03:14.704 --> 00:03:18.374
WE ARE TYPICAL AMERICANS.

00:03:16.739 --> 00:03:21.878
TENS OF MILLIONS OF AMERICANS

00:03:18.508 --> 00:03:25.315
CHERISH THEIR FAITH.

00:03:22.011 --> 00:03:26.616
SO, WHEN I HEARD THAT ABC HAD

00:03:25.448 --> 00:03:27.984
A PROGRAM WHERE MY CHRISTIAN

00:03:26.749 --> 00:03:30.019
FAITH WAS DESCRIBED AS A

00:03:28.117 --> 00:03:30.887
MENTAL ILLNESS, I THOUGHT IT

00:03:30.153 --> 00:03:31.220
WAS IMPORTANT FOR ME TO SPEAK

00:03:31.020 --> 00:03:32.422
OUT.

00:03:31.354 --> 00:03:33.623
NOT ON MY OWN BEHALF.

00:03:32.555 --> 00:03:41.731
WE KNOW THE CRITICISM COMES

00:03:33.756 --> 00:03:42.966
WITH THE PUBLIC LIFE.

00:03:41.864 --> 00:03:44.701
I WANTED TO DEFEND THE FAITH

00:03:43.099 --> 00:03:45.969
OF MILLIONS OF AMERICANS

00:03:44.834 --> 00:03:46.769
AGAINST THAT KIND OF SLANDER.

00:03:46.102 --> 00:03:48.404
AND I DID SO.

00:03:46.903 --> 00:03:49.639
I GIVE JOY A LOT OF CREDIT.

00:03:48.538 --> 00:03:50.573
SHE PICKED UP THE PHONE.

00:03:49.772 --> 00:03:52.075
SHE CALLED ME.

00:03:50.707 --> 00:03:53.409
SHE WAS VERY SINCERE.

00:03:52.208 --> 00:03:54.911
AND SHE APOLOGIZED.

00:03:53.543 --> 00:03:56.212
ONE OF THE THINGS MY FAITH

00:03:55.044 --> 00:03:58.114
TEACHES ME IS GRACE.

00:03:56.346 --> 00:03:58.481
FORGIVE AS YOU HAVE BEEN

00:03:58.247 --> 00:03:59.482
FORGIVEN.

00:03:58.681 --> 00:04:02.785
&gt;&gt; Sean: SO DOES MINE BUT

00:03:59.615 --> 00:04:03.519
I'M NOT AS GOOD AS IT AS YOU.

00:04:02.986 --> 00:04:07.023
&gt;&gt; Vice President Pence: I

00:04:03.653 --> 00:04:08.891
SAID OF COURSE, I FORGIVE YOU.

00:04:07.156 --> 00:04:09.292
THAT IS PART OF MY FAITH

00:04:09.025 --> 00:04:11.127
EXPERIENCE.

00:04:09.425 --> 00:04:12.428
BUT I DID ENCOURAGE HER AND I

00:04:11.260 --> 00:04:14.630
AM STILL ENCOURAGING HER TO

00:04:12.562 --> 00:04:16.299
USE THE FORM OF THE -- FORUM

00:04:14.764 --> 00:04:18.301
OF THAT PROGRAM OR ANOTHER

00:04:16.432 --> 00:04:20.636
FORUM TO APOLOGIZE TO TEN OF

00:04:18.434 --> 00:04:21.337
MILLIONS OF AMERICANS WHO WERE

00:04:20.770 --> 00:04:22.605
EQUALLY OFFENDED.

00:04:21.537 --> 00:04:24.807
&gt;&gt; Sean: SHE MAKES ME

00:04:22.739 --> 00:04:25.975
QUESTION THE SINCERITY OF IT.

00:04:24.941 --> 00:04:26.409
IT WASN'T JUST A SHOT AGAINST

00:04:26.109 --> 00:04:28.611
YOU.

00:04:26.542 --> 00:04:30.013
IT WAS AGAINST -- I'M A

00:04:28.745 --> 00:04:31.514
CHRISTIAN -- ANYBODY OF FAITH.

00:04:30.213 --> 00:04:33.082
&gt;&gt; Vice President Pence: FOR

00:04:31.647 --> 00:04:35.418
ME, IT WAS NEVER ABOUT ME.

00:04:33.282 --> 00:04:37.787
&gt;&gt; Sean: UNDERSTOOD.

00:04:35.551 --> 00:04:38.488
YOU DON'T TAKE IT PERSONALLY.

00:04:37.987 --> 00:04:39.322
&gt;&gt; Vice President Pence: I

00:04:38.621 --> 00:04:40.757
DIDN'T TAKE IT PERSONALLY.

00:04:39.455 --> 00:04:41.991
I THOUGHT IT WAS IMPORTANT IN

00:04:40.890 --> 00:04:43.626
THIS MOMENT THAT I SPEAK OUT

00:04:42.125 --> 00:04:46.129
ON BEHALF OF THE FAITH OF TENS

00:04:43.760 --> 00:04:50.900
OF MILLIONS OF AMERICANS.

00:04:46.262 --> 00:04:54.137
MY HOPE IS THAT JOY AND OTHERS

00:04:51.034 --> 00:04:59.876
ON THE AIRWAVES WILL COME TO

00:04:54.270 --> 00:05:02.645
APPRECIATE THE MEANING AND, IF

00:05:00.009 --> 00:05:04.280
I CAN SAY, THE JOY THAT COMES

00:05:02.779 --> 00:05:04.647
WITH THE FAITH AND RESPECT

00:05:04.414 --> 00:05:06.282
THAT.

00:05:04.847 --> 00:05:06.649
&gt;&gt; Sean: LAST QUESTION.

00:05:06.416 --> 00:05:08.584
2018.

00:05:06.783 --> 00:05:10.386
WE EXPECTED, THE DEMOCRATS

00:05:08.718 --> 00:05:10.686
EXPECTED A BIG BLUE WAVE IN

00:05:10.520 --> 00:05:11.788
TEXAS.

00:05:10.820 --> 00:05:13.056
THAT NEVER HAPPENED.

00:05:11.921 --> 00:05:14.690
TOMORROW THERE IS AN IMPORTANT

00:05:13.189 --> 00:05:17.160
RACE GOING ON IN THE

00:05:14.824 --> 00:05:26.102
PENNSYLVANIA 18th

00:05:17.293 --> 00:05:27.537
CONGRESSIONAL DISTRICT.

00:05:26.235 --> 00:05:28.771
A LOT OF TURMOIL FOR THE

00:05:27.670 --> 00:05:30.406
COUNTRY IF NANCY PELOSI BECAME

00:05:28.905 --> 00:05:31.140
THE SPEAKER AGAIN?

00:05:30.606 --> 00:05:32.475
&gt;&gt; Vice President Pence: THE

00:05:31.274 --> 00:05:32.909
ONLY THING AT STAKE IS

00:05:32.608 --> 00:05:34.544
EVERYTHING.

00:05:33.042 --> 00:05:35.945
IF YOU LIKE A GROWING ECONOMY,

00:05:34.677 --> 00:05:37.513
IF YOU LIKE 3 MILLION NEW

00:05:36.079 --> 00:05:40.216
JOBS, IF YOU LIKE A PRESIDENT

00:05:37.647 --> 00:05:42.485
REBUILDING THE MILITARY.

00:05:40.349 --> 00:05:42.919
STANDING TALL AND THE WORLD

00:05:42.618 --> 00:05:46.422
AGAIN.

00:05:43.052 --> 00:05:48.424
FIGHTING FOR THE FREE, FAIR

00:05:46.556 --> 00:05:50.159
AND RECIPROCAL TRADE TO

00:05:48.558 --> 00:05:52.228
APPOINT CONSERVATIVE TO THE

00:05:50.293 --> 00:05:52.995
COURT AND CUTTING TAXES WHAT

00:05:52.361 --> 00:05:57.834
HAPPENS TOMORROW IS MORE THAN

00:05:53.129 --> 00:06:00.837
THE TWO CANDIDATES ON THE

00:05:57.967 --> 00:06:02.004
BALLOT.

00:06:00.970 --> 00:06:03.106
THE PRESIDENT AND I BOTH

00:06:02.138 --> 00:06:04.707
CAMPAIGNED FOR RICK SACCONE.

00:06:03.239 --> 00:06:05.208
HE WOULD BE A FANTASTIC MEMBER

00:06:04.841 --> 00:06:06.442
OF CONGRESS.

00:06:05.341 --> 00:06:11.514
WORE THE UNIFORM OF THE UNITED

00:06:06.576 --> 00:06:13.483
STATES FOR NEARLY TWO DECADES.

00:06:11.647 --> 00:06:15.551
HE WAS ENDORSED BY THE

00:06:13.616 --> 00:06:16.052
"PITTSBURGH POST GAZETTE"

00:06:15.685 --> 00:06:17.920
SUNDAY MORNING.

00:06:16.185 --> 00:06:21.557
THAT ELECTION TO ME AND THIS

00:06:18.054 --> 00:06:23.726
FALL ELECTION ARE MORE ABOUT

00:06:21.691 --> 00:06:24.660
THE DIRECTION OF THE COUNTRY.

00:06:23.860 --> 00:06:25.661
PEOPLE OF PENNSYLVANIA HAVE AN

00:06:24.794 --> 00:06:27.263
OPPORTUNITY TO SEND A MESSAGE

00:06:25.795 --> 00:06:27.763
THEY SUPPORT THE DIRECTION OF

00:06:27.396 --> 00:06:29.765
PRESIDENT TRUMP.

00:06:27.964 --> 00:06:31.701
&gt;&gt; Sean: IT'S ALSO ABOUT THE

00:06:29.899 --> 00:06:32.435
CRUMBS THAT NANCY PELOSI TALKS

00:06:31.834 --> 00:06:34.537
ABOUT?

00:06:32.635 --> 00:06:36.639
&gt;&gt; Vice President Pence: IT

00:06:34.670 --> 00:06:38.207
REALLY IS.

00:06:36.772 --> 00:06:40.009
IF THE DEMOCRATS TOOK OVER THE

00:06:38.341 --> 00:06:41.010
CONGRESS IN THIS FALL'S

00:06:40.143 --> 00:06:42.044
ELECTION NANCY PELOSI WOULD BE

00:06:41.144 --> 00:06:44.814
SPEAKER OF THE HOUSE AGAIN.

00:06:42.178 --> 00:06:45.515
WE DON'T HAVE TO WONDER WHAT

00:06:44.947 --> 00:06:46.649
IT WOULD BE LIKE.

00:06:45.648 --> 00:06:47.650
I WAS IN CONGRESS THE LAST

00:06:46.782 --> 00:06:49.418
TIME IT HAPPENED.

00:06:47.783 --> 00:06:51.120
ALL ABOUT RAISING TAXES AND

00:06:49.552 --> 00:06:52.522
MORE REGULATIONS.

00:06:51.254 --> 00:06:53.589
THE DODD-FRANK BILL THAT

00:06:52.655 --> 00:06:58.194
KILLED COMMUNITY BANKING AND

00:06:53.723 --> 00:07:00.830
LENDING TO SMALL BUSINESS

00:06:58.327 --> 00:07:02.398
OWNERS.

00:07:00.963 --> 00:07:02.732
THEY FORCED OBAMACARE ON THE

00:07:02.532 --> 00:07:05.635
COUNTRY.

00:07:02.865 --> 00:07:07.170
WE KNOW THEY WOULD WANT TO

00:07:05.768 --> 00:07:07.637
TURN BACK THE PROGRESS THE

00:07:07.303 --> 00:07:08.771
PRESIDENT MADE.

00:07:07.770 --> 00:07:10.039
THAT IS WHY THE PRESIDENT ARE

00:07:08.905 --> 00:07:11.240
IN PENNSYLVANIA SATURDAY NIGHT

00:07:10.173 --> 00:07:12.808
AND WHY WE WITH CAMPAIGNING

00:07:11.374 --> 00:07:15.411
ALL OVER THE COUNTRY TO MAKE

00:07:12.942 --> 00:07:16.212
SURE WE RE-ELECT THE MAJORITY

00:07:15.545 --> 00:07:22.251
CONSERVATIVES ON CAPITOL HILL

00:07:16.345 --> 00:07:23.553
TO PARTNER FROM THE PRESIDENT.

